*.tsbuildinfo

# The console logs PAGE directory (operation/sign log pages) must not be
# swallowed by the machine-level global gitignore `logs` entry - batch 6b's
# index.tsx was silently left untracked by it (repo built only on machines
# where the file happened to exist). Same rescue pattern as the root
# .gitignore's !docs/deployment/*.sql negation.
!src/pages/system/logs/
!src/pages/system/logs/**
